<title>USA: Chrysler Corp may issue a $500 mln debt deal.</title>
<headline>Chrysler Corp may issue a $500 mln debt deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chrysler Corp is expected to bring a $500 million debt offering to market on Thursday, corporate bond syndicate sources said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a 100-year bond with price talk seen in the area of 81 basis points over U.S. Treasuries, sources said.</p>
<p>The issue has been well received by the market and is already issue-bid, sources added.</p>
<p>Salomon Brothers is expected to underwrite the debt offering, sources added.</p>
<p>(( --Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
